OL,3,ADeep-fried food banned under new school
OL,4,Adinner rules in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be a boost for fresh fruit
OL,7,Fand vegetables and deep-fried food will
OL,8,Fbe banned in what the government has
OL,9,Fcalled the biggest shake-up to school
OL,10,Fdinners in England in over a decade.
OL,12,FUnder new school food standards, fibre
OL,13,Fand wholegrains will also be increased,
OL,14,Fand breakfast clubs will have to follow
OL,15,Fnutrition rules for the first time,
OL,16,Fwith schools also being monitored.
OL,18,FThe Association of School and College
OL,19,FLeaders (ASCL) welcomed the changes,
OL,20,Fbut said they hoped the new rules would
OL,21,Fnot become "another stick with which to
OL,22,Fbeat head teachers".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
