OL,3,AReform confident it won't need to repay
OL,4,Aany of #72m under proposed new donor
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government is seeking to change the
OL,8,Flaw on donations to UK political
OL,9,Fparties from British expats, including
OL,10,Fa #100,000 cap backdated to 25 March.
OL,12,F"These two donations are entirely in
OL,13,Fline with the law as it is and, as far
OL,14,Fas we know, the law as it's going to be
OL,15,Fin the future," Jenrick said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
