OL,3,ASix dead, 130 missing after Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry capsizes in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FShips and a helicopter have been
OL,7,Fdeployed to the scene, with 280
OL,8,Fpersonnel taking part in a search and
OL,9,Frescue operation. All vessels in the
OL,10,Farea of the Java Sea have been alerted
OL,11,Fto report any signs of passengers.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
